  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The 2025 voluntary core funding grant to Irish Rule of Law International funds important Human Resources at HQ-level. Support to Headquarters will allow for leadership and administrative functions for the implementation of IRLI&#x2019;s ongoing rule of law and access to justice projects in Malawi, Tanzania, South Africa and Zambia. Core funding also supports the Ireland based programmatic activities including the facilitation of visits by high level delegations as well as annual reporting and donor engagement</narrative>
